Only Licensor, or someone expressly authorized by Licensor in writing,
may grant exceptions to these restrictions. A separate commercial
agreement controls the exceptions it expressly grants. Ask Akshay Sehgal
through https://github.com/Akshaysehgal88 and obtain an authenticated
